        "text": "In 2024, she said she was interested in funding a countywide homelessness prevention program through a tax on high-value property sales. That year, she also said she wanted to expand programming for incarcerated youth. In 2026, she sponsored a resolution for an independent review of the Cook County Jail after multiple deaths and concerns over medical care. In 2024, she also said she would support looking at ways to provide property tax relief.",
